# Misconfigurations accepted for now (CI: .github/workflows/security.yml,
# "IaC" job). One ID per line, then "#" and why. Remove an entry once fixed
# (or never, if it's a documented false positive).

# Root-user Dockerfiles: accepted temporarily pending review (PR #7) to avoid
# changing runtime users without validating each image separately.
DS-0002

# .devcontainer/Dockerfile: apt-get without --no-install-recommends; a
# dev-only image, not shipped, accepted temporarily pending review (PR #7).
DS-0029

# False positive: the key name "ENABLE_HEADER_PASSTHROUGH" in
# charts/mcp-stack/templates/configmap-gateway.yaml matches trivy's
# secret-like-key-name heuristic, but it holds a boolean feature flag, not a
# secret value.
KSV-0109
